# Oscillator Memory sample directory

This directory must contain the following sample files:

- sine.wav
- triangle.wav
- square.wav
- saw.wav
- fm.wav
- noise.wav
- correct.wav  (played on every correct pad press)
- wrong.wav    (played when the sequence is failed)

These samples are played by the Oscillator Memory mini-game on the 404 page.
The game will display a clear error message in the UI if any sample is missing.
